From 51d3e32e6a9e4374f5e67454fd9c1c1d79085dee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:10:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add dealer detail screen for Sales staff (contact, credit,
 order history)

Tapping a dealer in "My Dealers / Parties" now opens a real detail
screen so a rep can pull up everything needed before or during a call:

- get_dealer_detail() RPC: contact info (phone/email/address/GSTIN),
  credit limit + live outstanding (same ledger calc as
  get_my_dealers()), discount terms with net-rate calc, territory tags.
- get_dealer_orders() RPC: recent order history (status, amount, date).
- Both re-check the caller's role-based scope server-side (same rules
  as get_my_dealers()) before returning anything, so a rep can't view
  a dealer outside their own list by guessing its id.
- New DealerDetail.jsx screen at /staff/sales/dealer/:id, with
  tap-to-call/email links and a credit-used progress bar.

Also includes sales_dealer_assignment_fix.sql (already applied
directly in Supabase earlier) for the repo's migration history to
match what's actually live.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
